    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare</em></p><p>Harmless, many-colored magical energy crackles along this Tiny tuning fork. As a Magic action, you can tap the fork against any object to summon an Eldritch Eddy (see <em>Netheril’s Fall</em>), which appears in an unoccupied space as close to you as possible. The eddy is Friendly to you and your allies and obeys your commands; if you give it none, it defends itself against attackers but takes no other actions. It takes its turn immediately after yours on your Initiative count. The eddy disappears after 1 hour, when it dies, or when you dismiss it as a Bonus Action. The fork can’t be used this way again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-FggQ6cjjbXh8iXIK\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’Eldritch Eddy (<em>Netheril’s Fall</em>) n’existe pas dans dnd5e : l’activité <em>Summon Eddy</em> est vide, déposez-y la créature si vous l’avez. Elle compte l’utilisation du jour.</p></section>",
